	measure '_CF Date Days Higlighting' = ```


		VAR __Day_of_week = SELECTEDVALUE ( 'Dim_Calendar'[Day of Week Alt.] )

		VAR __InScope_check = 
		    ISINSCOPE ( 'Dim_Calendar'[Day Name Short] ) ||  ISINSCOPE ( 'Dim_Calendar'[Day of Month] )

		VAR __Result =
		    SWITCH (
		        TRUE(),
		            __Day_of_week IN {6,7},
		            "#DACDAC",
		            "#8AB0D3"
		    )

		RETURN __Result
		```
		displayFolder: Date related
		lineageTag: 500e2f64-4aed-48f9-9df3-de89ef470100

